    <title>bigbud v0.4.0-beta.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;First beta of 0.4.0: managed remote backends and signed backend graphs,&lt;br&gt;
peer orchestration, native mobile composition, persistent terminals,&lt;br&gt;
system-wide search (Mod+F and Mod+P across projects, this computer and&lt;br&gt;
connected remotes), terminal activity and finished-work notifications,&lt;br&gt;
terminal image and file paste, and security hardening.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
